WEBVTT

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.820
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.820
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.220
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.220
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.680
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.680
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:49.360
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:49.360
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.860
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.860
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.200
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.200
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.580
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.580
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:09.540
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:09.540
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:13.760
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:13.760
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.850
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.850
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:27.810
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:27.810
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.570
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.570
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:50.580
THE INSIGNIA OF AVAN

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:53.460
Sizzle!

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:07.850
Sir Avan!

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:14.320
Is everyone alright?

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:20.070
Thank goodness.
Talk about very nice timing.

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:21.780
Master!

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:25.330
I didn't think he had the strength.

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:30.250
Master, are you okay?

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:35.500
I'm in a lot of pain.
But I don't have time for that now.

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:39.010
He's more powerful than
when he was the Dark Lord.

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:43.800
Not only that, he has
the Dark King backing him.

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:49.270
Our enemy is far beyond my expectations.

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:51.690
With our current strength...

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:54.320
we can't win.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:55.400
But...!

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:59.900
That's why he...
Hadlar, the Dark Commander...

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:02.700
must be brought down here.

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:06.410
And Dai, Popp...

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:11.670
I ask that someday you two
defeat Vearn, the Dark King!

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:23.340
I underestimated you.
Well done, Avan, the Hero.

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:24.760
Wait...

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:26.970
Master, do you intend to die?!

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:29.520
Master, I'll fight with you!

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:32.230
Kaclang!

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:36.400
W-What's this?!

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:37.860
It's Kaclang!

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:39.070
Kaclang?!

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:41.990
It's a high-level defensive spell

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:47.080
that turns the body to steel
and repels any magical attack!

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:49.410
But if we're like this...

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:51.080
We can't move!

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.540
You should all be safe now.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:58.630
You may watch my final battle from there.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:01.220
By "final," you mean...!

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:04.970
Don't do this! I'll fight!
Together with you!

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:11.100
How foolish, Avan. To spend your remaining
Magic Power on your students.

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:25.820
Oh! Those are...!

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:29.580
Insignias of Avan!
Certificates of graduation!

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:30.950
Graduation?!

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:35.080
I give these to students
I believe are fully trained.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:39.340
Dai, you possess outstanding potential.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:46.800
I regret our training was cut short
at three days.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:49.470
If we continued for the remaining four...

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:53.430
I'm certain you could have become a Hero.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.350
Master Avan!

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:58.110
That is why I give this to you.

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:02.400
Continue with your training
and become a true Hero.

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:05.570
Master, I...!

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:07.110
Popp.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.820
Don't!

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:13.200
Don't do it, Master! I don't want that!

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:19.340
Stop being so morbid!
Our training isn't over yet!

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:21.050
Popp...

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:26.180
I don't care if you were the Hero once!
Why are you doing all this?!

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:29.720
You said yourself you can't beat him!

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:35.140
It's because I can't beat him
that I must risk my life.

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:38.650
Besides, Popp,

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:44.280
I believe the power we gain through
training should be used to help others.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:51.530
Perhaps my power was granted to me
by the gods to protect you on this day.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:53.990
Don't do this, Master!

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:57.000
Someday I know you will understand.

00:05:57.160 --> 00:06:00.500
So, hold onto this
for when that day comes.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:03.920
Master!

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:05.510
Master!

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:11.220
Oh my. You haven't officially graduated
and you're already so emotional.

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:18.810
You'll need to work much, much harder
to become Heroes worthy of those.

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:24.610
Mr. Brass and Gomechan,
thank you for everything.

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:27.610
Sir Avan, don't do anything rash!

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:33.240
Don't worry. I will not lose.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.580
Done saying goodbye to your students?

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:43.750
Let us fight, Hadlar!

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:46.420
Very well.

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:52.180
But having used your last Magic Power
to cast Kaclang has sealed your fate.

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:56.310
You've spent most of
your Magic Power, too!

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:14.120
Here goes!

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:22.880
Fool!

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:26.090
As we stand...

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:28.670
even with just combat skills...

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:32.380
I have more than enough...

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:34.720
power to...

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:37.720
tear you...

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:40.430
apart!

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:50.490
Master!

00:07:50.690 --> 00:07:52.610
Move! Move!

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:12.340
Die, Avan!

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:20.180
You...!

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:29.530
A spell?! Impossible!

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:33.450
You should be out of Magic Power!

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:36.240
This spell requires
very little Magic Power.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:42.040
Instead, it turns life energy
into explosive power to defeat enemies!

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:46.000
Wait! This spell is...!

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:51.260
Stop! Don't do it!

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:55.680
You'll die! It'll kill you too, Avan!

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:57.720
Do you want that?!

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:06.900
Popp, Dai! I leave the rest to you!

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:10.020
Stop!

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:16.530
Megante!

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:49.440
Master!

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:53.570
Sir Avan used the spell Megante.

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:55.150
Megante?

00:09:55.490 --> 00:10:02.080
He used the final destructive spell
that uses his own life to save his allies.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:05.580
Sir Avan, you truly are...

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:10.250
Master used his own life to protect us.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:12.960
Master...

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:18.550
SIZZLE
HEAT-TYPE SPELL

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:23.560
KABOOM
EXPLOSION-TYPE SPELL

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:30.060
Is that Master?!

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:38.240
Hadlar?!

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:43.910
No! Where's Master?!

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:56.800
You truly have grown weak, Avan!

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:03.890
You used your own life to cast Megante,
and you still couldn't defeat me!

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:10.270
Now there is nothing left to fear!
The Dark Army is unopposed!

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:14.190
He truly is a monster!

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:15.520
No way...

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:22.660
Curse you, Avan.

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:36.000
I need to wipe out your students
here and now.

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:44.300
Don't worry! The effects of
Sir Avan's Kaclang still remain!

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:46.930
It will repel any attack!

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.350
Don't be so sure.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:53.480
Having you immobile is perfect.

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:55.310
Huh?!

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:57.480
He can use Frizz, too?!

00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:03.410
My Frizz is pure hellfire.
It will burn until my target is destroyed.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:08.540
I simply cast it, and the moment your
Kaclang wears off, you'll turn to ashes!

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:11.040
Don't! Please don't!

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:16.250
You should be happy.
When you die, you can go to the afterlife.

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:20.840
Your precious master is there,
waiting for you.

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:25.970
<i>That's right! Master did it for us!</i>

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:28.100
<i>He gave his life so we could survive!</i>

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:35.850
<i>If we die here,
then what did he sacrifice himself for?!</i>

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:49.280
<i>I have my life
because Master gave it to me!</i>

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:03.840
<i>What?! Is he going to
break the Kaclang on his own?!</i>

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:10.930
<i>What is he?!</i>

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:18.810
He broke the Kaclang!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:23.070
You brat! Burn to death!

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:25.530
Kafrizz!

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:27.780
Kacrack!

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:38.580
Dai used magic?!

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:40.290
And it's stronger than mine!

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.380
My flames...

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:46.260
Then I'll just pummel you to death!

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:49.220
Die!

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:06.320
What is this power?!

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:11.910
Impossible! Th-That crest...!

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:24.170
A Dragon?!

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:29.800
What is that light?!

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:35.470
I remember!
Dai used powerful magic in battle before!

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:39.270
That mark appeared on his forehead then!

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:45.530
<i>A Dragon Crest?!
Is this boy a Dragon Knight?!</i>

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:47.110
<i>Impossible!</i>

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:50.700
How dare you...

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.030
How dare you kill Master!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.200
You'll pay for that!

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:00.710
Don't get cocky, boy!

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:11.430
Yes!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:17.180
This is impossible! I may have
sustained damage from Megante...

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:20.690
And he may be a student of Avan...

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:26.190
But how could I be overpowered
by a mere child?!

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:31.530
Die!

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:36.700
Die! Die!

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:42.750
Eat this!

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:46.090
Boom!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:53.140
Dai!

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:02.600
How's that? I used
the last of my Magic Power on that spell.

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:05.440
Surely he's dead now.

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:12.780
Dai! Don't tell me he killed you, too!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:17.700
That's right! There's no way I can lose!

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:32.380
Impossible!

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:52.280
I won't lose! Not to you!

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.620
Die!

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.290
Dai! Above you!

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:09.340
Feel how powerful Master's attack is...

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:15.550
for yourself!

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:18.930
What?!

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:20.140
Avan...

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:26.270
Strash!

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:44.290
Curse you, boy! I'll remember
this humiliation and your name!

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:48.460
I swear I will kill you! Dai!

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:17.110
Dai, are you okay?!

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:20.370
Grampa, Gomechan.

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:22.530
Where's Hadlar?!

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:28.870
Unfortunately, it seems he escaped.
I saw him use a Chimaera Wing.

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:30.330
Oh...

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:37.880
Master...

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:39.590
Master...

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:41.970
Master!

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:04.990
The magic circle of light remains
even after Sir Avan has gone.

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:07.620
He still protects us even now.

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:10.920
I told you Master is amazing.

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:12.210
Popp...

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:14.960
Dai, what will you do now?

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:15.840
Huh?

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:20.380
Will you continue
your magic training under me?

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:21.840
Or...

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:23.720
I...

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:32.940
Master gave me a mission.
To one day defeat Vearn, the Dark King.

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:38.320
That's why... I...

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:45.950
SOVEREIGN ROCK CASTLE

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:55.250
<i>I see you took quite the beating, Hadlar.</i>

00:19:55.750 --> 00:20:01.680
Forgive me, my Dark King,
for making you see me in this condition.

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:03.970
<i>It matters not.</i>

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:11.060
<i>You have buried Avan, the Hero.
Consider them wounds of honor.</i>

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:12.440
My Lord.

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:16.270
<i>I have placed all of my trust in you.</i>

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:22.030
<i>With your rival Avan dead,
no one can stop my Dark Army.</i>

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:27.030
<i>Go forth and fulfill your dream
of overthrowing the world.</i>

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:27.910
Yes, Sire!

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:34.880
<i>It's true that Avan is dead.</i>

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:40.050
<i>But that boy Dai is a far greater threat.</i>

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:48.430
<i>Wounded as I was, to overpower me,
Hadlar, the Dark Commander...</i>

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:53.230
<i>And that mark on his forehead.
The Dragon Crest.</i>

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:57.940
<i>If he really is a Dragon Knight...</i>

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:03.570
<i>And, with Avan's training,
if he manages to reach power of a Hero...</i>

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:09.160
<i>he will become
far more powerful than Avan!</i>

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:13.250
<i>The wounds I received from him
are proof of that.</i>

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:19.130
<i>The wound from Dai heals slower
than the wound from Avan.</i>

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:24.680
<i>In that instant,
Dai's blade surpassed that of his master!</i>

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:36.150
<i>If I let him live, he is sure to grow into
a terrifying enemy.</i>

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:48.740
I must crush him!
While he still remains a fledgling!

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:58.290
With my grand Dark Army!

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:25.990
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:25.990
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:32.990
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:32.990
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:36.210
<i>I'm not sure</i>

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:36.210
<i>doudarou</i>

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:44.170
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:44.170
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:46.720
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:46.720
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:52.850
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:52.850
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:01.730
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:01.730
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

00:23:01.900 --> 00:23:08.200
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

00:23:01.900 --> 00:23:08.200
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:14.030
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:14.030
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

